<title>CHINA: Ocean Info year net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Ocean Info year net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.2 gain     vs  9.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    25.52 profit vs  29.85 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,320.00     vs  1,307.28</p>
<p>    Company name		 Ocean Information Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 22-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Ocean Information is a personal computer manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one 1999 warrant for every five shares held. The bonus warrants will entitle holders thereof to subscribe for shares of the company at a subscription price of HK$1.10 per share, subject to adjustment, during the period from the date of issue to September 30, 1999.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
